<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Additional details for the experiments</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The hyperparameters for methods used in the material generation experiment and protein structure prediction are given in Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ A.1 Additional details for the experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ ESS-Flow: Training-free guidance of flow-based models as inference in source space" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Additional details for the experiments ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ ESS-Flow: Training-free guidance of flow-based models as inference in source space" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> respectively.</p>
</div>
